            <persName type="full">Arthur Wellesley</persName>
            <date type="birth" when="1769-05-01"/>
            <date type="death" when="1852-09-14"/>
            <note type="gender">M</note>
         </ab>
         <div type="bio">
            <p>Born in Ireland, became a major army officer and later Prime Minister, renowned for leading the British Army during the Napoleonic Wars and for defeating Napoleon. His name appears frequently in <name type="work" key="ID_MISSING">Finnegans Wake</name>, often in reference to the substantial monument in his honour located in Phoenix Park. Nicknamed the ‘Iron Duke’. <hi rend="bold">William Brockman</hi>
                </p>
         </div>
